      "en": "You hypocrites! Well did Isaiah prophesy of you, saying,",
      "ko": "외식하는 자들아 이사야가 너희에게 대하여 잘 예언하였도다 일렀으되",
      "source_text_hash": "bc3e6d80aeb09a4355fe66fc2fd659128c120c403dd4400da2225fa95168a65f",
      "translation_text_hash": "5311ce2791af84e2bec1f6a96a3c5c0b4cc07283b4182bbcf1feaff063e39dc7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
