      "en": "‘These people draw near to me with their mouth,and honor me with their lips; but their heart is far from me.",
      "ko": "이 백성이 입술로는 나를 존경하되 마음은 내게서 멀도다",
      "source_text_hash": "7681fce9cc4e54981432dc71c5d1c956e0162c9660b0a24a7023b6ef08d9b2a5",
      "translation_text_hash": "86e4959bc6e890d7a3b97289a0369da17fd3ccecc1222c0cfe58f99a8cf50199",
